cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AlloGate, please cite the software release and the associated method paper."
title: "AlloGate: auditable multiscale Gate interventions for molecular dynamics"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "陈"
    given-names: "华章"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-9668-1928"
version: 0.1.0a2
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/ChptrX/AlloGate"
abstract: >-
  AlloGate is an open method for learning multiscale geometric representations
  and auditing their influence on a fixed kinetic target through differentiable
  State, Relay, and Contact Gates.
keywords:
  - molecular dynamics
  - collective variables
  - geometric neural networks
  - interpretability
